observed = "RecipientAuthorization::encode carries binding_digest and message() requires it to be nonzero, but the signed message omits those 32 bytes. Replacing one nonzero binding_digest with another leaves message() identical and verify_signature accepts the same signature. No live caller was found that supplies an independent authenticated digest check."
