proposal = "Retire the obsolete settlement-recipient surface if it has no merged-network consumer. If retained, version the message in services/agent/crates/layerx-crypto/src/settlement_recipient.rs and its producer/consumer together to authenticate binding_digest, then assert changed-digest refusal with a real signed authorization."
